        "date": "2026-09-03T20:59:38.957Z",
        "text": "🇨🇭 Great time at AWS Summit Zurich!\n\nPhilipp Kaindl and I gave a talk on red teaming. As more applications rely on LLMs and AI agents, it becomes critical to know how to protect them against adversarial attacks like prompt injection, agent goal hijacking, context poisoning and many others. Always happy to discuss this topic with the community!",
